  "evidenceCatalog": [
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0001",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/0",
      "text": "1.公司生产运营所需物资和服务采购，包括：各类机械设备、 电气设备、信息设备、车辆、工器具、办公用品等的采购；相关 设备维修、运维服务采购； 以及车辆租赁、物流服务、物业服务 等的采购。",
      "valueDigest": "810598655a913ead"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0002",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/1",
      "text": "2.公司信息化建设相关项目采购，包括：根据公司信息化项 目的建设和开发需要，进行的软件产品、硬件产品、软硬件组件 的购买，以及信息化业务系统建设、开发、升级、技术服务等的 采购；",
      "valueDigest": "614c067d0ce36849"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0003",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/2",
      "text": "3.公司信息化系统运维采购，包括根据公司信息化项目运维",
      "valueDigest": "091cf6d4c8a51c7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0004",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/3",
      "text": "4.公司科技创新项目采购，包括根据公司科技创新工作需要， 进行科技创新相关项目和课题所需的物资、研究开发和技术服务 等的采购；",
      "valueDigest": "881f33384c79774f"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0005",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/4",
      "text": "5.公司劳务服务采购，包括为满足公司经营需要进行的劳务 服务采购；",
      "valueDigest": "00a0af753111058b"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0006",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/5",
      "text": "6.公司中介机构及咨询服务采购，包括为满足公司生产经营 活动所需的评估、审计、法律服务、咨询、代理、监理、鉴证、 测评等的服务采购。",
      "valueDigest": "2cb536383036ebc0"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0007",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/6",
      "text": "2.相关的设备、材料等货物单项合同估算价在 200 万元（含） 以上的；",
      "valueDigest": "778463484070778a"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0008",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/7",
      "text": "3.勘察、设计、监理等服务单项合同估算价在 100 万元（含） 以上的；",
      "valueDigest": "19febfbd1eea09ec"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0009",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/8",
      "text": "4. 同一项目 中可以合并进行的勘察、设计、施工、监理以 及与工程建设有关的重要设备、材料等的采购，合同估算价合 计达到前款规定标准的；",
      "valueDigest": "feda706b414274f5"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0010",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/9",
      "text": "5.其他按照国家有关规定必须招标的。",
      "valueDigest": "9062bbe283d0b5cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0011",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/10",
      "text": "1.技术复杂、有特殊要求或者受 自然环境限制，只有少量 潜在投标人可供选择的；",
      "valueDigest": "d6b2bbe262f346ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0012",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/11",
      "text": "2.涉及国家安全、 国家秘密或者抢险救灾，适宜招标但不 适宜公开招标的。",
      "valueDigest": "6d3beb6a5cbb29c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0013",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/12",
      "text": "1.技术复杂、有特殊要求或者受 自然环境限制，只有少数 潜在投标人可供选择的；",
      "valueDigest": "ed95339a5e916f98"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0014",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/13",
      "text": "2.涉及国家安全、 国家秘密、公司商业秘密、抢险救灾，适 宜招标但不适宜公开招标的。",
      "valueDigest": "8ed3102290e3ba44"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0015",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/14",
      "text": "50 万元以下的由经营管理部分管领导审批。",
      "valueDigest": "6a2f798af26ec000"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0016",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/15",
      "text": "50 万元（含） 以上的由总经理审批。",
      "valueDigest": "431c0cfc8b0741f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0017",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/16",
      "text": "1.将必须招标的项目化整为零或者以其他任何方式规避招 标；",
      "valueDigest": "d2c94e4187631335"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0018",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/17",
      "text": "2.与投标人串通进行虚假招标，明招暗定；",
      "valueDigest": "ea3a60d3c5c011b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0019",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/18",
      "text": "3.非法干预评标（含谈判/询价）小组工作、影响评标（含谈 判/询价）结果；",
      "valueDigest": "0a553dd9118542fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0020",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/19",
      "text": "4.以不合理的条件限制或排斥潜在投标人参与投标竞争或对 潜在投标人实行歧视待遇；",
      "valueDigest": "bb2e1a5efd8f839c"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0021",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/20",
      "text": "5.强制投标人组成联合体共同投标，限制投标人之间竞争；",
      "valueDigest": "88b87fa2fe63b1cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0022",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/21",
      "text": "6.在评标（含谈判/询价）小组按规定推荐的中标（成交）候 选人以外确定中标（成交）人；",
      "valueDigest": "55b53510e61716ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0023",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/22",
      "text": "7.其他违反国家有关法律、法规、规章和公司有关规定的行 为。",
      "valueDigest": "91f1b1c337c36726"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0024",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/23",
      "text": "8.所有参加采购活动的评标（含谈判）小组成员和工作人员 严禁有下列行为：",
      "valueDigest": "767f0186b135aa25"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0025",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/24",
      "text": "1、拟成交金额为 5 万元（含） 以上 50 万元以下的采购项目，经营管理部分管领导审批后执行。",
      "valueDigest": "53ca3419b03cc86f"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0026",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/25",
      "text": "2、拟成交金额为 50 万元（含） 以上 100 万元以下的采购项目，总经理审批后执行。",
      "valueDigest": "2e4e9aa58e0ad3fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0027",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/26",
      "text": "3、拟成交金额为 100 万元（含） 以上 1000 万元以下的采购项目， 由经营管理部组织报公司总经 理办公会决议后，总经理签名后执行。",
      "valueDigest": "febc452076e6bd77"
    },
    {
      "id": "raw.docx.paragraph.0028",
      "kind": "raw.docx.paragraph",
      "pointer": "/rawProbeFacts/structure/headingCandidates/27",
      "text": "4、拟成交金额为 1000 万元（含） 以上的采购项目， 由经营管理部组织报公司董事会决议后，董事长签 名后执行。",
      "valueDigest": "1c187e994b4b4093"
    },
