      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/11",
      "text": "2.涉及国家安全、 国家秘密或者抢险救灾，适宜招标但不 适宜公开招标的。",
      "valueDigest": "cb9773eafea7ce8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0013",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/12",
      "text": "1.技术复杂、有特殊要求或者受 自然环境限制，只有少数 潜在投标人可供选择的；",
      "valueDigest": "d749e81d2e3f1c32"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0014",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/13",
      "text": "2.涉及国家安全、 国家秘密、公司商业秘密、抢险救灾，适 宜招标但不适宜公开招标的。",
      "valueDigest": "5c697b2ae08ae1b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0015",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/14",
      "text": "50 万元以下的由经营管理部分管领导审批。",
      "valueDigest": "12f9f14e75ed7917"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0016",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/15",
      "text": "50 万元（含） 以上的由总经理审批。",
      "valueDigest": "5ce045506f36a394"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0017",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/16",
      "text": "1.将必须招标的项目化整为零或者以其他任何方式规避招 标；",
      "valueDigest": "3fafae0adeed0665"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0018",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/17",
      "text": "2.与投标人串通进行虚假招标，明招暗定；",
      "valueDigest": "59e9480532c9fba9"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0019",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/18",
      "text": "3.非法干预评标（含谈判/询价）小组工作、影响评标（含谈 判/询价）结果；",
      "valueDigest": "138d769b158bebbd"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0020",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/19",
      "text": "4.以不合理的条件限制或排斥潜在投标人参与投标竞争或对 潜在投标人实行歧视待遇；",
      "valueDigest": "4314fb435852b7bf"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0021",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/20",
      "text": "5.强制投标人组成联合体共同投标，限制投标人之间竞争；",
      "valueDigest": "55fc4202f46332ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0022",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/21",
      "text": "6.在评标（含谈判/询价）小组按规定推荐的中标（成交）候 选人以外确定中标（成交）人；",
      "valueDigest": "d50e84178ab364ea"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0023",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/22",
      "text": "7.其他违反国家有关法律、法规、规章和公司有关规定的行 为。",
      "valueDigest": "4465c220ef808e6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0024",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/23",
      "text": "8.所有参加采购活动的评标（含谈判）小组成员和工作人员 严禁有下列行为：",
      "valueDigest": "c5133afb5889671c"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0025",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/24",
      "text": "1、拟成交金额为 5 万元（含） 以上 50 万元以下的采购项目，经营管理部分管领导审批后执行。",
      "valueDigest": "d3a4e0d28263e005"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0026",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/25",
      "text": "2、拟成交金额为 50 万元（含） 以上 100 万元以下的采购项目，总经理审批后执行。",
      "valueDigest": "1534402bea27c22f"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0027",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/26",
      "text": "3、拟成交金额为 100 万元（含） 以上 1000 万元以下的采购项目， 由经营管理部组织报公司总经 理办公会决议后，总经理签名后执行。",
      "valueDigest": "b25efebec7ceac3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "profile.structure.0028",
      "kind": "profile.structure",
      "pointer": "/structureProfile/sections/27",
      "text": "4、拟成交金额为 1000 万元（含） 以上的采购项目， 由经营管理部组织报公司董事会决议后，董事长签 名后执行。",
      "valueDigest": "fde4f7069046848c"
    },
    {
