          "styleId": null,
          "text": "云南省大数据有限公司采购管理制度（暂行）"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": true,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 9,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "第一章 总则"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 10,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 13,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "第一条 为规范云南省大数据有限公司（以下简称“公司 ”） 的采购工作，提高采购效率和质量，降低采购成本，防范采购风 险，根据《中华人民共和国招标投标法》、《中华人民共和国政 府采购法》等相关法律法规，结合公司实际制定本制度。"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 11,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "第二条 本制度适用于公司的采购工作管理。"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 12,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 5,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "第三条 本制度所称采购，包括公司工程建设和生产经营相关 的工程、货物、服务等的采购。"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 13,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 5,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "第四条 公司采购工作应当遵循公开、公平、公正和诚实信用 原则；坚持公平竞争，阳光择优。"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 14,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 5,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "第五条 公司采购工作必须遵守国家有关法律、法规和规章的 有关规定，并依法接受监督。"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": true,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 15,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "第二章 采购管理机构与职责"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 16,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "第六条 总经理办公会采购管理职责"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 17,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 5,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "总经理办公会负责管理和监督公司采购工作，指导、协调公 司采购活动，并将公司采购管理的重大事项报公司党委会、董事 会决策。主要职责包括："
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 18,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 5,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "（ 一）贯彻落实《中华人民共和国招标投标法》及国家有关 政策法规和规章；"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 19,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "（二）研究决策公司采购工作的重大问题；"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 20,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "（三）审批公司采购项目的采购结果；"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 21,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "（四）对公司采购工作实施管理、监督和检查；"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 22,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "（五）将公司采购管理的重大事项报党委会、董事会决策；"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 23,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 1,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "（六）完成其他需要公司总经理办公会研究审批的采购事项。"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 28,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "第七条 采购管理职能部门职责"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 29,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 4,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "公司下设采购工作办公室，办公室设在经营管理部。经营管 理部是公司采购业务归口管理部门，其主要职责为："
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 30,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 7,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "（一）依据国家法律、法规、规章有关规定，组织制定和完 善公司有关采购管理规章制度，建立健全公司采购管理内控机制, 规范采购业务流程和管理程序，对采购业务流程中的廉洁风险进 行管控；"
        },
        {
          "fontSizesHalfPoints": [],
          "fonts": [],
          "hasBold": false,
          "hasItalic": false,
          "hasUnderline": false,
          "index": 31,
          "numberingId": null,
          "numberingLevel": null,
          "runCount": 3,
          "styleId": "BodyText",
          "text": "（二）组织各部门编制公司招标及非招标采购项目的相关方 案及文件；"
        }
      ],
